id reservoir-balance
title Project a week of reservoir storage
lang trebago
audience water utilities, catchment managers, municipal planners
safety advisory
summary Daily inflow, releases and demand give the exact storage for each day of the week. A day below empty or above full is held for a person; the plan is a proposal only.
inputs inputs.txt
step balance trebago reservoir.tb advisory nonneg=storage,headroom labels=days
